00:00:28.319 --> 00:00:30.479
Whether it be on purpose or not.

00:00:30.479 --> 00:00:32.755
- I can confirm that's
how a lot of Aussies speak

00:00:32.755 --> 00:00:34.091
in country towns.

00:00:34.091 --> 00:00:35.681
So Anchorman, you came pretty close.

00:00:35.681 --> 00:00:36.517
You did a good job.

00:00:36.517 --> 00:00:39.107
- Now just goes to (mumbles)

00:00:39.107 --> 00:00:40.382
a bunch of malarkeys.

00:00:40.382 --> 00:00:42.452
- They put in words that
we never use like malarkey.

00:00:42.452 --> 00:00:45.227
- When you hear an Australian
accent in a Hollywood film,

00:00:45.227 --> 00:00:46.852
it does stand out like dog's balls.

00:00:46.852 --> 00:00:48.467
